      "id": "claim_f683842638f04c0c979fcefeb3894f56",
      "statement": "In respond_or_tool mode, the tool-calling loop aborts when the same (tool, args, result) triple repeats in a sliding window of 5, redirects the model to use tools up to 2 times when it answers without tools while tools are available, and does a final inference when max_tool_cycles is exhausted.",
