      "id": "claim_140c4363b2d7450492de49f07ef7ef43",
      "statement": "When workflow.agents is non-empty, the engine auto-injects a run_agent tool into the tool schema listing each declared worker, so the model delegates via the same tool-calling path and workers run through their own AgentRuntime lifecycle.",
